    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The highly anticipated follow up to Indoor Kickball! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Indoor Baseball is BIGGER, <i>better</i>, and even more <i><u>destructive</u></i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indoor Baseball is a 1v1 baseball game played in the rooms of your house! Play in a goofy story mode to work your way up to make the school baseball team. Play a 14 game randomly generated season mode, or quick play 1v1 in a local multiplayer match against a friend or CPU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/f8b9d8c8a9f3625be7ae6cc4941f73f5.webp?t=1743813108\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each field has their own unique ways to hit home runs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through the window in the living room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the ball into the mini hoop in the bedroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ding the ball into the toilet in the bathroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of other insane ways to hit home run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/873c2aa1b4b122cee209764f6f8f8435.poster.avif?t=1743813108\" width=598 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/873c2aa1b4b122cee209764f6f8f8435.webm?t=1743813108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/873c2aa1b4b122cee209764f6f8f8435.mp4?t=1743813108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/42095e1a46181ab13310ecbc0a15f4bf.webp?t=1743813108\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through windows for home runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid physics obstacles to field the ball and run the bases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy too much and you may run in to an angry parent during your game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/7ea655b61b866612fbbe3ea88d466826.poster.avif?t=1743813108\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/7ea655b61b866612fbbe3ea88d466826.webm?t=1743813108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/7ea655b61b866612fbbe3ea88d466826.mp4?t=1743813108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/4c111e92c1373efb270471e3d88493cf.webp?t=1743813108\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in a randomly generated season mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it to playoffs for a chance to win the Championship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can lead the league in home runs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434700/extras/6bf3313440d819b026e4cf0ca1a172ef.webp?t=1743813108\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting cut from the school's baseball team, you are determined to prove you belong on the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play enough games to work your way up the ladder to get another try out for the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy too many things and your parents might make you do some chore mini games through out your journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique ways to hit home runs, unique to each field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw from a selection of 10 different pitch types, depending on your character selection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a 12+ different characters, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock home run celebrations, home run explosions, and strike out celebrations/taunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a ridiculous story mode to see if you can improve enough to make your school's baseball team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a randomly generated 14 game season to with the championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend and play 1v1 local multiplayer (*requires controller for 2nd player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Angry Mom or Angry Dad make an appearance to ruin your destructive fun?!</p></li></ul>",
