6bf3313440d819b026e4cf0ca1a172ef.webp?t=1743813108\" width=500 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After getting cut from the school's baseball team, you are determined to prove you belong on the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play enough games to work your way up the ladder to get another try out for the team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy too many things and your parents might make you do some chore mini games through out your journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique ways to hit home runs, unique to each field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw from a selection of 10 different pitch types, depending on your character selection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a 12+ different characters, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock home run celebrations, home run explosions, and strike out celebrations/taunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a ridiculous story mode to see if you can improve enough to make your school's baseball team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a randomly generated 14 game season to with the championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a friend and play 1v1 local multiplayer (*requires controller for 2nd player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Angry Mom or Angry Dad make an appearance to ruin your destructive fun?!</p></li></ul>",
